WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Booki. A calmer way to use Windows.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Everything you use. One beautiful dock.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Live, at a glance. Time, weather, CPU, tasks and music — right on the bar.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
A little more focus. Timer, tasks, calendar and weather. All local.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Find any app. Fast. Suggestions from your own usage. Nothing leaves your PC.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Make it yours. Preview your dock, pick how it behaves, keep your profiles.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Light or dark. At home in either.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Private by design. No accounts. No telemetry. Open source. Booki 0.70 · Free for Windows 10 & 11 · github.com/punkable/booki
